@@ -162,6 +162,65 @@ Available audio output drivers are:
 ``audiounit`` (iOS only)
     Native iOS audio output driver using ``AudioUnits`` and AudioToolbox.
 
+``ohaudio`` (HarmonyOS only)
+    Native HarmonyOS audio output. OHAudioSuite processing is disabled by
+    default and requires API 23 or newer (HOA space rendering requires API
+    26). Unsupported effects fall back to plain OHAudio output.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-effect=<effect>``
+        Select ``off``, ``equalizer``, ``noise-reduction``, ``sound-field``,
+        ``audio-separation``, ``voice-beautifier``, ``environment``,
+        ``audio-mixer``, ``space-render``, ``pure-voice-change``,
+        ``general-voice-change``, ``tempo-pitch``, or ``hoa-space-render``.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-eq-preset=<preset>``
+        Select ``custom``, ``default``, ``ballads``, ``chinese-style``,
+        ``classical``, ``dance``, ``jazz``, ``pop``, ``r-and-b``, or ``rock``.
+        The custom 31 Hz through 16 kHz gains are set with
+        ``--ohaudio-suite-eq-31`` through ``--ohaudio-suite-eq-16k`` and have
+        a range of -10 dB to +10 dB.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-sound-field=<front-facing|grand|near|wide>``
+        Select the sound-field effect variant.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-environment=<broadcast|earpiece|underwater|gramophone>``
+        Select the environment effect variant.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-beautifier=<clear|theatre|cd|studio>``
+        Select the voice beautifier variant.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-space-mode=<position|rotation|extension>``
+        Select the space-rendering mode. Position and rotation use
+        ``--ohaudio-suite-space-x``, ``-y``, and ``-z`` (each -5 to 5 m).
+        Rotation additionally uses ``--ohaudio-suite-space-time`` (2 to 40 s)
+        and ``--ohaudio-suite-space-direction``. Extension uses
+        ``--ohaudio-suite-space-radius`` (1 to 5 m) and
+        ``--ohaudio-suite-space-angle`` (1 to 359 degrees).
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-pure-gender=<female|male>``
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-pure-type=<cartoon|cute|female|male|monster|robots|seasoned>``
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-pure-pitch=<value>``
+        Configure traditional voice changing. A pitch of 0 uses the system
+        recommendation; custom values must be between 0.3 and 3.0.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-general-type=<type>``
+        Select ``cute``, ``cyberpunk``, ``female``, ``male``, ``mix``,
+        ``monster``, ``seasoned``, ``synth``, ``trill``, or ``war``.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-tempo=<0.5-10>``
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-pitch=<0.1-5>``
+        Configure tempo and pitch processing. Tempo changes audio duration and
+        are therefore not suitable when normal video synchronization is
+        required.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-separation-output=<vocals|accompaniment|mix>``
+        Select which source-separation result is sent to the audio device.
+
+    ``--ohaudio-suite-hoa-layout=<layout>``
+        Select a first-, second-, or third-order ``acn-n3d``, ``acn-sn3d``, or
+        ``fuma`` HOA layout. The decoded channel order must already match the
+        selected layout.
+
 ``openal``
     OpenAL audio output driver.
 
